{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Blink bundle feels like a useful next step because it adds doorbell and indoor coverage to the Blink camera I already have.",
    "The memory card and reader support recording and transferring footage from my camcorder, provided the card is compatible."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Another streaming device adds little when I already have a 4K Stick and a Fire TV television; the HD Stick offers no clear improvement for me.",
    "The large hard drive, Wi-Fi extender, and cable clips address needs I have not expressed. Owning electronics does not mean I currently need more storage, better coverage, or cable organization.",
    "The Ring doorbell serves a relevant purpose, but I would prefer to expand my existing Blink setup. The Echo speakers are related to my devices without meeting a pressing need."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My Fire TV purchases seem to have been taken as a reason to recommend more streaming devices, even when they duplicate what I already use.",
    "Alexa compatibility and general electronics ownership seem to count too heavily without a clear reason I would need each item now."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "I care about whether a purchase adds a useful capability to my existing setup, such as doorbell coverage, rather than repeating an existing function.",
    "Accessories feel relevant when they support a specific device and task, such as using my camcorder; compatibility still matters before I would choose them."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my connected-home and video interests but often confuse related products with useful next purchases."
}"}
